{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "2cd9bd0bf5cdde30f01ff04496fb47aaac02d5cfe8117e47388cb26d9643be42", "documents": [{"id": "offline-2cd9bd0bf5cdde30f01f", "filename": "7-Part C.mp3", "sha256": "2cd9bd0bf5cdde30f01ff04496fb47aaac02d5cfe8117e47388cb26d9643be42", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/2cd9bd0bf5cdde30f01ff04496fb47aaac02d5cfe8117e47388cb26d9643be42.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/2cd9bd0bf5cdde30f01ff04496fb47aaac02d5cfe8117e47388cb26d9643be42.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}, {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1Z4_B5EKEiYeuG5F0QtnpCHR0QFGaLt4J-C-0", "label": "Jahshan set 7 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [96, 97, 98, 99], "questions": [{"number": 31, "prompt": "What problem does Dr Cox identify concerning dementia patients?\nA. to educate young sportspeople in how to avoid getting it.\nB. Their condition can develop in a number of different ways.\nC. to provide a range of specialist advice about it.", "sourcePage": 96, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "Why did Dementia Australia decide to examine the issue of end-of-life\ndementia care?\nA. There was a lack of reliable information on it.\nB. The number of stories about poor care made it urgent.\nC. There were enough data on which to base an effective care plan.", "sourcePage": 96, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "For Dr Cox, the initial results of the dementia survey reveal that palliative care\nA. was working more effectively than people had thought.\nB. was more widely available than some users imagined.\nC. was viewed negatively by medical professionals.", "sourcePage": 96, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "Dr Cox says that lack of knowledge of the law by care professionals\nA. proves that family members should help make pain management decisions.\nB. could be resulting in a surprisingly high number of premature deaths.\nC. may lead to dementia patients experiencing unnecessary distress.", "sourcePage": 97, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "Dr Cox thinks that the statistics she quotes on refusing treatment\nA. illustrate a gap in current medical education programmes.\nB. show how patients' wishes are too often misunderstood by carers.\nC. demonstrate the particular difficulties presented by dementia patients.", "sourcePage": 97, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "Dr Cox makes the point that end-of-life planning is desirable because\nA. it reduces the complexity of certain care decisions.\nB. it avoids carers having to speculate about a patient's wishes.\nC. it ensures that everyone receives the best possible quality of care.\nNow look at extract two.\n\nExtract 2: Questions 37-42\nYou hear a hospital doctor called Dr Keith Gardiner giving a presentation about some research\nhe's done on the subject of staff-patient communication.\nYou now have 90 seconds to read questions 37-42.", "sourcePage": 97, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "Dr Gardiner first became interested in staff-patient communication after\nA. experiencing poor communication as an in-patient.\nB. observing the effects of poor communication on a patient.\nC. analysing patient feedback data on the subject of communication.", "sourcePage": 98, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "What point does Dr Gardiner make about a typical admission to hospital?\nA. The information given can overwhelm patients.\nB. Patients often feel unable to communicate effectively.\nC. Filling in detailed paperwork can be stressful for patients.", "sourcePage": 98, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "Dr Gardiner uses an example of poor communication to illustrate the point that\nA. patients should be consulted about the desirability of a hospital stay.\nB. specialists need to be informed if there are any mental health issues.\nC. relatives' knowledge of a patient's condition shouldn't be taken for granted.", "sourcePage": 98, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "Dr Gardiner explains that a survey conducted among in-patients about\ncommunication\nA. measured the difference between their expectations and their actual experience.\nB. asked their opinion about all aspects of the service they received.\nC. included questions on how frequently they visited the hospital.", "sourcePage": 99, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "One common complaint arising from Dr Gardner's survey concerned\nA. a lack of privacy for patients receiving sensitive information.\nB. the over-use of unclear medical terminology with patients.\nC. a tendency not to address patients in a respectful way.", "sourcePage": 99, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 42, "prompt": "How does Dr Gardiner feel about the results of the survey?\nA. surprised by one response from patients\nB. reassured by the level of patient care identified\nC. worried that unforeseen problems were highlighted\nYou now have two minutes to check your answers.\nEND OF THE LISTENING TEST", "sourcePage": 99, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["2cd9bd0bf5cdde30f01ff04496fb47aaac02d5cfe8117e47388cb26d9643be42"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
